# Direct sum of quiver representations
%%%
tag := "Chapter2/Definition2.8.9"
number := false
%%%
**Definition 2.8.9.** The **direct sum** of two representations $`(V_i, x_h)` and $`(W_i, y_h)` is the representation $`(V_i \oplus W_i, x_h \oplus y_h)`.
